    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About PRO ELEVEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRO ELEVEN</strong> is an online football game where you control and develop a single player to compete with others on the field.<br>Create your own unique player, grow their abilities, and aim to become the best on the pitch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played using a combination of mouse and keyboard.<br>Your player's movement and pass direction are controlled based on the position of the mouse cursor, allowing for intuitive and responsive gameplay.<br>Natural cursor movement enables you to perform the plays you\u2019ve always imagined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Status</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PRO ELEVEN is currently in development.<br>Many features are still under construction, and animations and gameplay logic are in an early stage.<br>This game is being developed by a solo developer with no formal background in game development.<br>It has been in development for about two months through self-learning and iteration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Plans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be continuously updated to improve its quality and add new features.<br>Feedback is welcome and will help shape the development process toward a more complete and enjoyable experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About PRO ELEVEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRO ELEVEN</strong> is an online football game where you control and develop a single player to compete with others on the field.<br>Create your own unique player, grow their abilities, and aim to become the best on the pitch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played using a combination of mouse and keyboard.<br>Your player's movement and pass direction are controlled based on the position of the mouse cursor, allowing for intuitive and responsive gameplay.<br>Natural cursor movement enables you to perform the plays you\u2019ve always imagined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Status</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PRO ELEVEN is currently in development.<br>Many features are still under construction, and animations and gameplay logic are in an early stage.<br>This game is being developed by a solo developer with no formal background in game development.<br>It has been in development for about two months through self-learning and iteration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Plans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be continuously updated to improve its quality and add new features.<br>Feedback is welcome and will help shape the development process toward a more complete and enjoyable experience.</p>",
